  "verseCount": 16,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "3",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1TI 3"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "3",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The saying is sure: If any one aspires to the office of bishop, he desires a noble task. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now a bishop must be above reproach, the husband of one wife, temperate, sensible, dignified, hospitable, an apt teacher, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "no drunkard, not violent but gentle, not quarrelsome, and no lover of money. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He must manage his own household well, keeping his children submissive and respectful in every way; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "for if a man does not know how to manage his own household, how can he care for God's church? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He must not be a recent convert, or he may be puffed up with conceit and fall into the condemnation of the devil;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3.6",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Or",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "slanderer",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "moreover he must be well thought of by outsiders, or he may fall into reproach and the snare of the devil.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3.7",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Or",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "slanderer",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Deacons likewise must be serious, not double-tongued, not addicted to much wine, not greedy for gain; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "they must hold the mystery of the faith with a clear conscience. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And let them also be tested first; then if they prove themselves blameless let them serve as deacons. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The women likewise must be serious, no slanderers, but temperate, faithful in all things. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Let deacons be the husband of one wife, and let them manage their children and their households well; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "for those who serve well as deacons gain a good standing for themselves and also great confidence in the faith which is in Christ Jesus.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.3.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I hope to come to you soon, but I am writing these instructions to you so that, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "if I am delayed, you may know how one ought to behave in the household of God, which is the church of the living God, the pillar and bulwark of the truth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Great indeed, we confess, is the mystery of our religion:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.3.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
